        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard door‑to‑door shift from Hyderabad to Cochin covers roughly 850 km and usually completes in 2‑3 business days. The exact duration depends on traffic, weather, and any checkpost clearances, but our dedicated fleet and live GPS tracking ensure timely delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken for bike shifting on the Hyderabad‑Cochin route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We use purpose‑built two‑wheeler carriers equipped with wheel chocks, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and hydraulic loading ramps. Each bike is wrapped in our 7‑layer protective system and secured on a multi‑axle trailer, guaranteeing safe time packers and movers hyderabad standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the Hyderabad to Cochin moving tariff?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our cost matrix is fully transparent. The quoted price includes base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, and standard handling. Extra services such as disassembly, heavy‑item lifting, or storage are itemised separately, so you’ll never face surprise fees.</p>
